sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor 运维 as 运维人员
    participant FE as 前端 SelfHealPanel
    participant API as lib/api/iqd.ts
    participant BFF as IqdAclController→IqdFacadeService
    participant APC as AiPlatformClient
    participant WR as ai-platform IqdSelfHealRouter
    participant SVC as IqdAskService
    participant CLI as IqdCli
    participant W as WrenAI CLI
    participant CFG as IqdConfigClient
    participant MI as mis-iqd IqdInternalController
    participant JOB as iqd_sync_job

    Note over 运维,FE: 点「强制重建」→ 二次确认弹窗(Q2) → 确认
    运维->>FE: 点击 强制重建(确认)
    FE->>FE: gate 检查(无进行中 / SYNCING / stale_drift)
    FE->>API: selfHealForceRebuild(connectionId)
    API->>BFF: POST /api/v1/iqd/self-heal/force-rebuild
    BFF->>BFF: requirePermission(iqd:selfheal:exec)
    BFF->>APC: selfHeal("force-rebuild", conn, auth, traceId)
    APC->>WR: POST /api/v1/iqd/self-heal/force-rebuild {connection_id, wait:true}
    WR->>SVC: trigger_force_rebuild(conn, wait=true)
    SVC->>CLI: context_build(force=True, ...)
    CLI->>W: wren context build <force_build_args>
    W-->>CLI: stdout(mdl_hash) / stderr
    CLI-->>SVC: result
    SVC->>CLI: memory_index()
    CLI->>W: wren memory index
    W-->>CLI: result
    SVC->>CFG: report_sync_job({action:"force_rebuild", build_status, build_mdl_hash, index_status, ...})
    CFG->>MI: POST /internal/v1/iqd/enhance/sync-job
    MI->>JOB: upsert(覆盖写, 含 action 列)
    SVC-->>WR: SyncResult(build_status, mdl_hash, error?)
    WR-->>APC: 200 {code:0, data: SyncResult}
    APC-->>BFF: data
    BFF-->>API: data
    API-->>FE: IqdSelfHealResult
    FE->>FE: 更新按钮态 / 失败横幅(REQ-7) / mdl_hash

    Note over FE,JOB: 状态回报 → 前端 5000ms 轮询(复用 CatalogSyncStatusBar)
    loop 每 5000ms
        FE->>API: getIqdCatalogSyncStatus(connectionId)
        API->>BFF: GET /api/v1/iqd/catalog/sync-status
        BFF->>MI: getCatalogSyncStatus(conn)
        MI->>JOB: findTopByConnectionIdOrderByIdDesc
        JOB-->>MI: 最新作业(build_status/index_status/mdl_hash/action)
        MI-->>BFF: {edit_status, build_status, mdl_hash, ...}
        BFF-->>API: data
        API-->>FE: IqdCatalogSyncStatus
        FE->>FE: 渲染 5 态徽标 + mdl_hash
    end

    Note over 运维,W: 重新索引 / 模型校验 同类路径(分别调 re-index / validate 端点，串联 memory_reset / context_validate)
